    "Every operation returns Result<its declared record, Error>. Configured methods borrow &Session.",
    "Opaque Session and Builder own independent implementation data; data setup is outside this namespace.",
    "Calendar::from_flag -> Result<Calendar,Error>; Calendar::flag -> i32.",
    "LocalSolarTimes retains real seven/ten producer arrays; RiseTransitTimes retains actual one/ten or absent transport.",
    "Visibility scalar is Some only for an actual scalar producer channel, never a converted integer status.",
